  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - Cybersecurity Solutions Reverse Trade Mission Series, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) series will familiarize public and private sector representatives from sub-Saharan Africa specifically Nigeria, Ghana, Cote d&apos;Ivoire, the DRC, and Senegal with the latest U.S. technologies, services, and best practices in cybersecurity solutions. The RTMs will include meetings with U.S. industry representatives, associations, financial institutions, and U.S. government agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
